# xcode
# Per-user IDE state. The previous pattern `*.xcuserdata/` only matched
# directories *ending in* ".xcuserdata" — the real directory is plain
# "xcuserdata", so this never matched and the state was committed.
xcuserdata/
*.xcuserdatad/
*.xcuserstate
*.xcscmblueprint
DerivedData/
.swiftpm/xcode/xcuserdata/

